sequenceDiagram
    participant W as ⌚ Apple Watch
    participant I as 📱 iPhone
    participant S as 🔷 Fleet Status Fast v2
    participant T as 🔒 Tailscale VPN
    participant F as 🛡️ Fleet Control API<br/>(port 3847)
    participant G as 🦞 OpenClaw Gateway<br/>(port 18789)
    participant TG as 💬 Telegram<br/>@SAMyosin_bot

    Note over W,TG: === Quick Status Flow ===
    
    W->>S: Tap "Quick Status"
    S->>T: GET /fleet/health<br/>Authorization: Bearer &lt;token&gt;
    T->>F: Route via 100.66.145.48
    F->>F: Validate token
    F->>G: HTTP GET http://127.0.0.1:18789
    G-->>F: 200 OK (45ms)
    F->>F: Check PID via gateway.pid
    F-->>T: {status: "healthy", responseTime: 45, pid: 12345}
    T-->>S: JSON Response
    S-->>W: 🟢 "Gateway Healthy (45ms)"

    Note over W,TG: === Remote Restart Flow ===

    I->>S: Tap "Restart Gateway"
    S->>I: ⚠️ "Restart OpenClaw Gateway?"
    I->>S: Confirm "Restart"
    S->>T: POST /fleet/restart<br/>Authorization: Bearer &lt;token&gt;
    T->>F: Route via 100.66.145.48
    F->>F: Validate token
    F->>F: Check rate limit (5/hr)
    
    Note over F,G: Method 1: SIGUSR1 (preferred)
    F->>G: kill -SIGUSR1 &lt;PID&gt;
    G->>G: In-process restart
    
    F->>F: Wait 5s...
    F->>G: Health check: GET 127.0.0.1:18789
    G-->>F: 200 OK ✅
    
    F->>TG: 🔔 "Gateway Restart Alert<br/>Trigger: manual (API)<br/>Method: SIGUSR1<br/>Result: ✅ Healthy"
    F-->>T: {success: true, method: "SIGUSR1"}
    T-->>S: JSON Response
    S-->>I: ✅ "Gateway restarted successfully"

    Note over W,TG: === Watchdog Auto-Recovery Flow ===

    loop Every 60 seconds
        Note over F: Watchdog (launchd timer)
        F->>G: Health check
        G-->>F: ❌ Timeout / Error
        F->>F: Failure count: 1
        F->>G: Health check (next cycle)
        G-->>F: ❌ Timeout / Error
        F->>F: Failure count: 2 → AUTO RESTART
        F->>G: kill -SIGUSR1 &lt;PID&gt;
        G->>G: Restart
        F->>G: Verify health
        G-->>F: 200 OK ✅
        F->>TG: 🔴 "Auto-Restart Alert<br/>Trigger: watchdog<br/>2 consecutive failures"
    end

    Note over W,TG: === Telegram Restart Flow ===

    TG->>F: /restart (from authorized user)
    F->>F: Validate Telegram user ID
    F->>TG: ⏳ "Restarting gateway..."
    F->>G: kill -SIGUSR1 &lt;PID&gt;
    G->>G: Restart
    F->>G: Verify health
    G-->>F: 200 OK ✅
    F->>TG: ✅ "Gateway restarted successfully"
